   ],
   "cues": [
    {
     "t0": 0.2,
     "t1": 4.5,
     "text": "These devices that now go everywhere with people, in their hands and in their homes,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 4.5,
     "t1": 10.5,
     "text": "have become a constant companion, always by a person's side."
    },
    {
     "t0": 10.5,
     "t1": 16.5,
     "text": "How much faith they have weakened!",
     "emph": true
    },
    {
     "t0": 16.5,
     "t1": 23.5,
     "text": "This device that so many people carry in their hands and pockets,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 23.5,
     "t1": 28.5,
     "text": "how great its effect has been in weakening faith and thinning out religion.",
     "emph": true
    },
    {
     "t0": 28.5,
     "t1": 33.5,
     "text": "Because of what is poured into it, the tools of destruction"
    },
    {
     "t0": 33.5,
     "t1": 41.5,
     "text": "aimed at religion, character, and belief, which has harmed many young people."
    },
    {
     "t0": 41.5,
     "t1": 45.5,
     "text": "So closing the doors that weaken faith",
     "emph": true
    },
    {
     "t0": 45.5,
     "t1": 50.5,
     "text": "and thin out one's religion is a fundamental requirement."
    },
    {
     "t0": 50.5,
     "t1": 56.5,
     "text": "But to walk into these polluted sites without a care,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 56.5,
     "t1": 60.5,
     "text": "suspicious places, places of vice,"
    },
    {
     "t0": 60.5,
     "t1": 65.5,
     "text": "and still expect your faith to stay sound?"
    },
    {
     "t0": 65.5,
     "t1": 69.5,
     "text": "Impossible! It is like throwing a man into the sea, bound,",
     "emph": true
    },
    {
     "t0": 69.5,
     "t1": 73.5,
     "text": "and telling him: \"Beware of getting wet!\""
    },
    {
     "t0": 73.5,
     "t1": 79.1,
     "text": "You must take the means of safety, by closing these doors.",
     "emph": true
    }
   ]
